      "message": "@Malcolm... PDN selection is per APN. This is the same for both IWLAN in LTE and in 5G. Subscriptions have nothing to to with it since this is already within a subscription (not cross-subscription). Selecting a subscription happens at a higher level: if not, then someone messed up the design.",
      "parentUuid": "e0ce973b_2f7af9ca",
